0 FILE quiet-partner.ldr
0 Quiet Partner — a passive tuned vibration absorber
0 Name: quiet-partner.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/quiet-partner.txt
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // One SPIKE Prime hub, motor A, two entirely passive weighted rotors.
0 // Compared model differs only by removal of the two absorber bands.
0 // Exact stock connections; no hidden joints or prescribed output motion.
0 // Band elasticity is the unmodified native approximation, not a measured rubber calibration.
0 // Build from the saved zero pose. Physical build and cable routing require checking.
0 // Assembly group 1
